OL,3,AWatch live as Last Night of the Proms
OL,4,Apays tribute to Dolly Parton with
OL,5,Amedley of her biggest hits
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's the finale of the world's biggest
OL,8,Fclassical music festival at the Royal
OL,9,FAlbert Hall in London, watch the Last
OL,10,FNight of the Proms above
OL,12,FSheridan Smith, Beverley Knight and
OL,13,FWard Thomas are paying tribute to Dolly
OL,14,FParton following her death last month -
OL,15,FThe hair is big, the suit is glittery
OL,16,Fand the atmosphere is jolly - the Queen
OL,17,Fof Country would have loved it
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
